    "body": "The [`aria-details`](https://www.w3.org/TR/wai-aria-1.1/#aria-details) property can maybe do what you want, but understand [its support is mixed](https://a11ysupport.io/tech/aria/aria-details_attribute) (what I consider poor). In other words do not rely on it unless you are prepared to test it across all targeted browser/SR combinations.\r\n\r\nUsing just a plain text reference is fine. It will also benefit more than SR users (think coga users, zoom users, sighted SR users who get even more impatient with the extra announcements, etc).",
